ms":0,"compare_at_price":null,"position":3,"product_id":7735874879536,"created_at":"2025-09-07T12:26:49+03:00","updated_at":"2026-08-16T18:04:10+03:00"}],"images":[{"id":36993417478192,"created_at":"2025-09-07T12:26:55+03:00","position":1,"updated_at":"2025-09-07T12:26:57+03:00","product_id":7735874879536,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0648\/9577\/8864\/files\/layering-pistachio.jpg?v=1757237217","width":1080,"height":1080}],"options":[{"name":"size","position":1,"values":["100 ml","50 ml","30 ml"]}]},{"id":7909727961136,"title":"Bleu Exclusive","handle":"bleu-exclusive","body_html":"\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan class=\"s1\"\u003eBleu Exclusive\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"p2\"\u003eNot every man tries to attract attention. Some simply walk into a room and are noticed naturally.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cspan class=\"s2\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"p2\"\u003eBleu Exclusive is crafted for the man who treats his appearance as part of his identity. The businessman who understands that details such as tailoring, presence, posture, and scent are not luxury choices, but priorities.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cspan class=\"s2\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"p2\"\u003eA fragrance that reflects quiet confidence and refined authority. It opens with a subtle freshness before evolving into a deep, creamy woody amber signature that feels polished, professional, and undeniably elegant.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cspan class=\"s2\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"p2\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"s2\"\u003eThis isn’t a scent for occasions.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"s2\"\u003eIt’s the signature of a man who takes himself seriously, every single day.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cspan class=\"s2\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"p2\"\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan class=\"s1\"\u003eNotes\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"s2\"\u003eTop Notes: Soft citrus freshness with aromatic nuances\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"s2\"\u003eHeart Notes: Creamy sandalwood blended with warm leathery labdanum\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"s2\"\u003eBase Notes: Deep woody amber accords enriched with smooth vanilla and refined woods\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan class=\"s1\"\u003eBest For\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cspan class=\"s2\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"s2\"\u003eBusiness meetings and professional environments\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"s2\"\u003eFormal and smart-casual looks\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"s2\"\u003eEvening wear and elegant occasions\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003eYear-round use, especially in moderate and cooler weather\u003c\/p\u003e","published_at":"2026-02-27T15:40:44+02:00","created_at":"2026-02-27T14:52:54+02:00","updated_at":"2026-08-16T18:04:10+03:00","vendor":"Bleu De Chanel L’exclusif","product_type":"","tags":[],"variants":[{"id":42805930295344,"title":"30 ml","option1":"30 ml","option2":null,"option3":null,"sku":null,"requires_shipping":true,"taxable":false,"featured_image":null,"available":true,"price":"750.00","grams":0,"compare_at_price":null,"position":1,"product_id":7909727961136,"created_at":"2026-02-27T15:11:13+02:00","updated_at":"2026-08-16T18:04:10+03:00"},{"id":42805930328112,"title":"50 ml","option1":"50 ml","option2":null,"option3":null,"sku":null,"requires_shipping":true,"taxable":false,"featured_image":null,"available":true,"price":"1100.00","grams":0,"compare_at_price":null,"position":2,"product_id":7909727961136,"created_at":"2026-02-27T15:11:13+02:00","updated_at":"2026-08-16T18:04:10+03:00"},{"id":42805930360880,"title":"100 ml","option1":"100 ml","option2":null,"option3":null,"sku":null,"requires_shipping":true,"taxable":false,"featured_image":null,"available":true,"price":"1900.00","grams":0,"compare_at_price":null,"position":3,"product_id":7909727961136,"created_at":"2026-02-27T15:11:13+02:00","updated_at":"2026-08-16T18:04:10+03:00"}],"images":[{"id":38736820699184,"created_at":"2026-02-27T15:10:40+02:00","position":1,"updated_at":"2026-02-27T15:10:42+02:00","product_id":7909727961136,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0648\/9577\/8864\/files\/IMG-3917.jpg?v=1772197842","width":1080,"height":1080}],"options":[{"name":"Size","position":1,"values":["30 ml","50 ml","100 ml"]}]},{"id":7735875272752,"title":"Male Elixir","handle":"male-elixir","body_html":"\u003cp\u003eMale Elixir\u003cbr\u003e\nIn the dimly lit streets of a cosmopolitan city, a man strolled confidently, leaving a trail of allure in his wake. His presence was like a symphony of elegance and sensuality, embodied in the fragrance he wore. With each step, notes of intoxicating vanilla and golden honey enveloped him, blending seamlessly with the warmth of tonka and the soothing essence of lavender. Crisp mint added a refreshing twist, while whispers of tobacco added depth and intrigue. As he passed, heads turned, captivated by the irresistible allure of his scent, a subtle yet undeniable declaration of his magnetic charm.\u003c\/p\u003e","published_at":"2024-05-04T17:35:42+03:00","created_at":"2025-09-07T12:27:24+03:00","updated_at":"2026-08-16T18:04:10+03:00","vendor":"Le Male Elixir JPG","product_type":"","tags":["Best Selling","Men"],"variants":[{"id":42389310242864,"title":"100 ml","option1":"100 ml","option2":null,"option3":null,"sku":"SL-001","requires_shipping":true,"taxable":false,"featured_image":null,"available":false,"price":"1250.00","grams":0,"compare_at_price":"0.00","position":1,"product_id":7735875272752,"created_at":"2025-09-07T12:27:24+03:00","updated_at":"2026-08-16T18:04:10+03:00"},{"id":42389310275632,"title":"50 ml","option1":"50 ml","option2":null,"option3":null,"sku":"SL-001","requires_shipping":true,"taxable":false,"featured_image":null,"available":false,"price":"750.00","grams":0,"compare_at_price":"0.00","position":2,"product_id":7735875272752,"created_at":"2025-09-07T12:27:24+03:00","updated_at":"2026-08-16T18:04:10+03:00"},{"id":42389310308400,"title":"30 ml","option1":"30 ml","option2":null,"option3":null,"sku":"SL-001","requires_shipping":true,"taxable":false,"featured_image":null,"available":true,"price":"450.00","grams":0,"compare_at_price":"0.00","position":3,"product_id":7735875272752,"created_at":"2025-09-07T12:27:24+03:00","updated_at":"2026-08-16T18:04:10+03:00"}],"images":[{"id":36993420263472,"created_at":"2025-09-07T12:27:31+03:00","position":1,"updated_at":"2025-09-07T12:27:33+03:00","product_id":7735875272752,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0648\/9577\/8864\/files\/male-elixir.jpg?v=1757237253","width":1080,"height":1080}],"options":[{"name":"size","position":1,"values":["100 ml","50 ml","30 ml"]}]},{"id":7735873044528,"title":"Citrine","handle":"citrine","body_html":"\u003cp\u003eCitrine by Siwa Fragrances is a modern masculine fragrance crafted for those who command attention without saying a word. Clean yet sensual, vibrant yet deep — Citrine is your daily signature scent.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 16px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%;\"\u003eNotes \u0026amp; Character\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTop Notes: Bright and zesty grapefruit opens the scent with a burst of citrus energy, perfect for a fresh start to your day.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eHeart Notes: The spice of ginger blends with soft ambrette, creating a warm, aromatic core that adds depth and character.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBase Notes: A smooth, skin-like blend of musk and ambroxan offers sensuality and longevity, leaving a clean yet memorable trail.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 16px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%;\"\u003eCitrine is made for men who value minimalism with presence. \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 16px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%;\"\u003eIt’s the kind of scent people remember — not because it shouts, but because it lingers.\u003c\/span\u003e \u003cspan style=\"font-size: 16px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%;\"\u003eYou’ll smell like your best self — confident, clean, and put-together.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 16px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%;\"\u003eWhy Citrine is One of the Best Men’s Perfumes\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCrafted by Siwa Fragrances with premium-quality ingredients\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFeatures a modern blend of citrus, spice, and musk\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePerfect balance of freshness and sensuality\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSleek, minimalistic scent profile — easy to wear, hard to forget\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePackaged with sophistication and made to impress\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhether you’re walking into a meeting, a café, or a quiet evening with someone special, Citrine by Siwa Fragrances gives you the perfect scent of self-assurance.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAdd Citrine to your collection today — and step into your signature scent.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cdiv id=\"wpforms-991\" class=\"wpforms-container \"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"wpforms-head-container\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"wpforms-title\"\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c!-- .wpforms-container --\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","